        "description": "Variable neurological impairment including developmental delay",
        "category": "supportive",
        "requiredForDiagnosis": false
      }
    ],
    "minimumForDiagnosis": "Presence of bilateral mandibular hypoplasia and multiple rib gap defects confirmed by imaging",
    "notes": "Genetic testing may support diagnosis but is not definitive; diagnosis primarily clinical and radiological."
